{title: 286 - Wonderful Words of Life}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #286 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 286}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Sing them over a[C7]gain to me, wonderful words of [F]life,
[F]Let me more of their [C7]beauty see, wonderful words of [F]life;
[F]Words of life and [Bb]beau[F]ty teach me faith and [Bb]du[F]ty.
[C7]Beautiful words, [F]wonderful words, [C7]wonderful words of [F]life,
[C7]Beautiful words, [F]wonderful words, [C7]wonderful words of [F]life.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[F]Beautiful [C7]words, [F]wonderful words,
[F]wonderful [C7]words [F]of life,
[F][Bb]Beautiful [F]words, [Bb]wonderful [F]words,
[C7]wonderful [F]words [C7]of [F]life.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Christ, the [C7]bless'd One, [F]gives to all
[F]wonderful [C7]words [F]of life;
[F]Sinner, [Bb]list [F]to [Bb]the [F]loving call,
[C7]wonderful [F]words [C7]of [F]life;
[C7]All [F]so [C7]freely [F]given,
[F]wooing [C7]us [F]to heaven.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]Sweetly [C7]echo the [F]Gospel call,
[F]wonderful [C7]words [F]of life;
[F]Offer [Bb]pardon [F]and [Bb]peace [F]to all,
[C7]wonderful [F]words [C7]of [F]life;
[C7][F]Jesus, [C7]only [F]Savior,
[F][C7]sanctify [F]forever.
{end_of_verse}
